#: 7d4a93aeeaae4d5780dc0e85f2950e14
msgid ""
"Most methods have an alias defined to specify its binding group. For "
"example, the calls bound from the AP_AHRS library, have an alias defined as "
"\"ahrs\" by the description line in its group:"
