#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-binding-syntax.rst:23
#: 523721a25a9041b0a1c953e9b89c8e78
msgid "Methods"
msgstr "方法"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-binding-syntax.rst:25
#: 7c1b95c800e244d49a21b091a73ab014
msgid ""
"The majority of bindings are methods used to get information into and out of"
" the running ArduPilot firmware. In the `bindings.desc "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/generator/description/bindings.desc>`_"
" file listing these, each are grouped by their association with the "
"underlying ArduPilot code module's \"\\*.h\"header file. A method usually "
"has the form of:"
msgstr ""
"大多数绑定是用于从运行中的 ArduPilot 固件获取和输出信息的方法。在列出这些内容的 `bindings.desc "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/generator/description/bindings.desc>`_"
" 文件中，每个方法都按其与底层 ArduPilot 代码模块 「\\*.h」 头文件的关联分组。方法通常的形式为："

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-binding-syntax.rst:27
#: 36112da52c1c46798672b300827da436
msgid ""
"**singleton <binding group name> method <method name> <function type> "
"<argument types/ranges>**"
msgstr "**singleton <绑定组名> method <方法名> <函数类型> <参数类型/范围>**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-binding-syntax.rst:29
#: eeb286bc434b454e9d923f8374f6ef65
msgid "<method name> is the name of the function to call"
msgstr "<方法名> 是要调用的函数名称"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-binding-syntax.rst:30
#: 68c78f5c845248148a2fcfc6f8455312
msgid "<function type> type of C++ function that is being called."
msgstr "<函数类型> 被调用的 C++ 函数类型。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-binding-syntax.rst:31
#: 02c3e7cb57124483bc1bd194510b64c1
msgid ""
"<argument types/ranges> variable type returned or, type and range for "
"variable used as input to C++ function being called. These are best "
"understood by referencing the C++ function in the code being called and "
"correlating them to the function's arguments."
msgstr ""
"<参数类型/范围> 返回的变量类型，或作为输入传给被调用 C++ 函数的变量类型和范围。最好通过参考代码中被调用的 C++ "
"函数，并将其与函数的参数对应来理解。"

